{"version":1,"key":"card:772","content":{"id":772,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"2e5fea56-9293-46a6-b676-488a46f31213","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"悬空指针（Dangling Pointer）指的是指针原本指向有效的数据，但数据被释放后，指针依旧保留着那个地址。此时通过这个指针去访问或写入，行为是未定义的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"ecb6a240-c0de-4f9c-8da1-f499c5d33898","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"常见的产生方式有两种。一种是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"free"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之后继续使用原指针："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"C","uuid":"d4415c01-0f1d-4db8-9512-4dff9e61c377","collabId":"03e5345d-6fbf-4c88-82e6-f8d25c26a8be","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"#include <stdlib.h>\n\nint main() {\n    int *p = malloc(sizeof(int));\n    *p = 10;\n\n    free(p);   // p 指向的内存已经被释放\n\n    *p = 20;   // 错误：p 现在是悬空指针\n}"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"be696292-d75a-4f5c-aae4-897456890977","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另一种是返回了局部变量的地址，函数返回后栈帧被回收，指针指向的内存已经失效："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"C","uuid":"3b2196e3-4172-4430-9c4d-c79bc959ea12","collabId":"e5c27727-d4fb-49ef-a2e9-2331d2c42b06","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"int* foo() {\n    int x = 10;\n    return &x;  // 错误：x 是局部变量，函数结束后就失效\n}\n\nint main() {\n    int *p = foo();\n    *p = 20;    // 错误：p 是悬空指针\n}"}],"tags":["C","内存管理/悬空指针"],"createTime":1782912611570,"updateTime":1791442672226,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791442672226}}